en, stays)\n\nCI on 08d3cd5986: passed (run ci-0001).", "reviewers": ["alex"]}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The PR request timed out, so I don't know whether it was created. I'll check the open PRs before retrying so I don't open a duplicate.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PRBhpLR8qiZZTCKxzDYCXZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"state": "open"}, "name": "list_prs", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The timeout hit after the PR was created: #101 exists with the right branch and title, but no reviewers were attached. Rather than open a duplicate, I'll add alex as reviewer on #101.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01BnmiyizxM7axNQkKfd9Rnx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"]}, "name": "request_review", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The nightly failure is fixed and the pull request is open for review.\n\n- **Fix:** `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on the new branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`. That matches the docstring and the test (2.675 \u2192 2.68, 2.665 \u2192 2.66).\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **Pull request:** #101 is open against `main`, and alex is requested as reviewer.\n\nThe first attempt to open the PR timed out. It had still been created, but with no reviewers. I checked the open PRs, found #101, and added alex to it instead of opening a second PR. There is only one PR for this change.\n\nNothing has been merged. Merging into `main` needs approval from a code owner.", "type": "text"}]}]}